{
  "airport": "VVTS",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-08-12",
  "notes": "Rewritten from the real official procedure document 'Phuong thuc khai thac hai duong CHC song song tai Cang HKQT Tan Son Nhat' (kem theo Quyet dinh so 8.../QD-CHK ngay 10/01/2024), at vietnam_ats_routes_pack/Du lieu PTB + code/QD duong CHC song song/CHC Song song VVTS.pdf. This document explicitly prints the full SUPER/HEAVY/MEDIUM/LIGHT wake-turbulence matrix (identical to the one in the VVNB document), which supersedes an earlier, wrong, partial matrix used in a previous version of this file (that version had e.g. SUPER-MEDIUM=7NM, HEAVY-HEAVY=4NM, HEAVY-MEDIUM=5NM which do not match the real doc's 8NM/5NM/6NM). It also fixes an operator bug on the crossing-time rule (must be <=45s, was previously written as >=45s) and replaces a vague '8-point checklist' placeholder with the real 9-point reduced-separation checklist text.",
  "rules": [
