      "severity": "VIOLATION", "source_document": "CHC Song song VVTS.pdf", "source_section": "4.2.1.1(c), 4.2.1.2(c), 4.2.1.3(b), 4.2.1.4(a), 4.2.2(a)", "effective_date": "2026-08-12", "version": "2.0.0" },
